---

## Features

- Monte Carlo crystal growth simulation
- Solid-on-Solid surface model
- Zinc Blende crystal model
- Periodic boundary conditions
- Surface roughness analysis
- RHEED intensity estimation
- GPU acceleration with Numba CUDA
- Performance benchmarking

---

## Technologies

- Python
- NumPy
- Numba
- CUDA
- Matplotlib
- Jupyter Notebook

---

## Results

The repository contains representative simulation outputs, including:

- Crystal growth animations
- Surface morphology evolution
- RHEED oscillation plots
- Surface roughness analysis
- GPU vs CPU performance benchmarks

Example outputs are available inside:

```
